#chip 16F1829, 8

'Repeat For test (Change 1654): WaitL1 1009 us plus an If (GATE FIX shape) inside the loop body on 16F1829
'Expect: compiles, and the whole Repeat For construct runs exactly 40,000 clock cycles
'(checked by simulating the generated assembly instruction by instruction)

#option explicit
Dim Flag As Bit
Dim X As Byte
Repeat For 20 ms
    WaitL1 1009 us
    nop
    If Flag = 1 Then
        X = X + 1
        Flag = 0
    End If
End Repeat
Do
Loop
